  "id": "concentration",
  "term": "concentration",
  "definition": "Concentration is a state of sustained, exclusive attention focused on specific contents. In this state, what is attended to becomes stronger in consciousness while other contents are more strongly shut out, making concentration a matter of how intense the attention is.",
